    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pool_desc",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Features:\n• ThreadPoolExecutor for parallelism\n• Shared memory (no pickling issues)\n• Timeout per computation\n• Default reward on timeout/error\n• Accepts any RewardFunction (including RewardManager)",
      "originalText": "Features:\n• ThreadPoolExecutor for parallelism\n• Shared memory (no pickling issues)\n• Timeout per computation\n• Default reward on timeout/error\n• Accepts any RewardFunction (including RewardManager)",
